  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我有这个知情权  (I Have a Right to Know)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Returning to Xin Huimei's apartment amid the media firestorm, Chun Yuqiao promises to resolve the lawsuit himself yet begs her never to get tangled up with Luo Lin again—sparking their first painful argument. Listen to Xin Huimei and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你回来了？对不起啊，我惹麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我会想办法解决。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是真的怪我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一定要用这首歌吗？惠美，我真的不需要这样的成就。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是怕那些媒体炒作吗？为什么到我这里你就接受不了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们能不能不要再跟洛琳扯上任何关系？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次你又被骗了，你又被利用了，我会生气，我会心疼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你觉得我是那个被人当枪使的傻子，还是天天需要被你保护的麻烦精啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道你是个独立的人，但是保护你是我的义务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "谈到义务了，你跟洛琳的过去到底是怎么一回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我现在是你的女朋友，我有这个知情权！我也不是傻子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司有事要加班，晚上我住办公室。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你回来了？对不起啊，我惹麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're back? I'm so sorry — I caused a huge mess.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我会想办法解决。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will find a way to solve it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是真的怪我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you truly blaming me right now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一定要用这首歌吗？惠美，我真的不需要这样的成就。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you really have to use that song? Huimei, I truly don't need that kind of past glory.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是怕那些媒体炒作吗？为什么到我这里你就接受不了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you afraid of media hype? Why is it that when it comes to me, you suddenly can't accept it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们能不能不要再跟洛琳扯上任何关系？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can we please stop getting entangled with Luo Lin in any way at all?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次你又被骗了，你又被利用了，我会生气，我会心疼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This time you were deceived and used all over again — that makes me angry, and it hurts me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你觉得我是那个被人当枪使的傻子，还是天天需要被你保护的麻烦精啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you see me as a fool used as someone's pawn, or a walking disaster who needs your protection every day?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道你是个独立的人，但是保护你是我的义务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know you are an independent woman, yet protecting you is my duty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "谈到义务了，你跟洛琳的过去到底是怎么一回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Speaking of duty, then — what exactly happened in the past between you and Luo Lin?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我现在是你的女朋友，我有这个知情权！我也不是傻子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am your girlfriend now, and I have a right to know! I am nobody's fool!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司有事要加班，晚上我住办公室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There's urgent work at the office — I'll stay at the office tonight.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你回来了？对不起啊，我惹麻烦了。",
